---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Add a mixin kit to an existing sandbox

Usage: bento kit add [OPTIONS] <SANDBOX> <REFERENCE>

Arguments:
  <SANDBOX>
          Sandbox name

  <REFERENCE>
          Mixin kit: a registry reference or a local path (./dir or descriptor)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

      --kit-arg <NAME=VALUE>
          Kit argument: NAME=VALUE, or KIT.NAME=VALUE for one kit (repeatable)

      --kit-args-file <FILE>
          Read kit arguments (NAME=VALUE lines) from a file (repeatable)

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -y, --yes
          Grant the kit's network access without asking

  -h, --help
          Print help
